Modified files
--------------
The following files are derived from openarm_description and were modified
by NITRo-UI. They are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  - NITRoman/nitro_description/xacro/openarm.xacro
      OpenArm model integrated into NITRoman as a xacro macro; meshes and
      materials changed.
  - NITRoman/nitro_description/meshes/arm/v10/visual/*light.stl
      Lightweight versions of the OpenArm arm link visual meshes.
  - NITRoman/nitro_description/meshes/arm/v10/collision/*_symp.stl
      Simplified versions of the OpenArm arm link collision meshes.
  - NITRoman/nitro_description/meshes/ee/openarm_hand/
      Lightweight / modified versions of the OpenArm hand meshes.
  - choreonoid_model_NITRoUI/model/nitromanlight.body
      OpenArm model converted to the Choreonoid body format and integrated
      into NITRoman, using the modified meshes above.

NITRoman/nitro_description/xacro/nitroman.xacro uses the modified OpenArm
model via openarm.xacro.

"OpenArm" is used here only to identify the origin of these files. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Enactic, Inc.

